  "description": "My name is Woo-Min! I'm a bright-eyed middle school student. And yet, I... ended up on the street?! I slowly turned my head and our eyes met: Mimi. She wore panties on her head, handed Woomin a pair of panties, and disappeared. And so, the transfer student who appeared before Woo-Min, who had hoped his dark past would be forgotten, was Mimi?! The two met again, and panties!\n\n *\"Hey, give me my panties.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
